## Which License Should I Choose?

### Choose Open Source License (Free) if:
- ✅ Personal or hobby project
- ✅ Open source project
- ✅ Educational or learning project
- ✅ Non-profit organization
- ✅ You can include attribution to CertifySphere

### Choose Commercial License (Paid) if:
- ✅ Commercial/business website
- ✅ Client projects (agencies, freelancers)
- ✅ SaaS or web application
- ✅ Cannot or don't want to show attribution
- ✅ Need priority support
- ✅ Want to resell or white-label

