## Frequently Asked Questions

**Q: Can I use this for my business website?**
A: Yes, with either license. Open source requires attribution, commercial does not.

**Q: Can I modify the template?**
A: Yes, both licenses allow full modification.

**Q: Can I use this for client projects?**
A: Yes. Open source requires attribution on each site. Commercial license allows unlimited client projects without attribution.

**Q: What counts as attribution?**
A: A visible link or text credit to CertifySphere on the website (footer, about page, or credits page).

**Q: Can I remove the "Created by CertifySphere" from the footer?**
A: Only with a commercial license. Open source license requires this attribution.

**Q: Do I need a separate license for each project?**
A: Open source: No, use freely with attribution. Commercial: Depends on license tier purchased.

**Q: What if I start with open source and want to upgrade?**
A: Contact us anytime to purchase a commercial license and remove attribution.

